# Project NoéMI - Client tenant configuration directory.
#
# This directory holds per-client provisioned configurations produced by the
# Client Onboarding agent (agents/operations/client-onboarding.md).
# Each subdirectory `clients/<client-id>/` typically contains:
#   - mcp.config.json   (per-client active MCP and skill assignment)
#   - GEMINI.md         (generated context, vendored per client)
#   - notes.md          (operator-managed handoff notes; never secrets)
#
# Client configurations are environment-specific and not committed to the
# public reference architecture. The `.gitkeep` file below preserves the
# directory while ignoring all generated client tenants.

*
!.gitignore
!.gitkeep
!README.md
